ive longer!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2286750/extras/8ea0de16a0520c485b0f0b59b5dc8c85.poster.avif?t=1675325063\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2286750/extras/8ea0de16a0520c485b0f0b59b5dc8c85.webm?t=1675325063\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2286750/extras/8ea0de16a0520c485b0f0b59b5dc8c85.mp4?t=1675325063\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong><u>Weapons!</u></strong><br>After 5 Waves you can choose a Weapon that slightly enhances you to play different. You take the Miner-Weapon? Mine the hell outa' those Asteroids and go for Turrets. You take the Sniper? Execute High Level Enemies within seconds! You like Explosions? BOOM! Rocket-Launcher. Flame-Thrower? Burn. Them. Down!!<br><br><u>Rocket-Launcher</u><br>Exploding-Bullets deal massive AOE-Damage!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2286750/extras/11d7920a7b3a4165431ba1c9fb77c511.poster.avif?t=1675325063\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2286750/extras/11d7920a7b3a4165431ba1c9fb77c511.webm?t=1675325063\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2286750/extras/11d7920a7b3a4165431ba1c9fb77c511.mp4?t=1675325063\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><u>Sniper</u><br>Powerfull Single-Target Bullets execute Enemies!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2286750/extras/2ce19fa3caa1504317d68380e87710c2.poster.avif?t=1675325063\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2286750/extras/2ce19fa3caa1504317d68380e87710c2.webm?t=1675325063\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2286750/extras/2ce19fa3caa1504317d68380e87710c2.mp4?t=1675325063\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><u>Flame-Thrower</u><br>Damages many Enemies at once!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2286750/extras/6937badf4822cfd7a9b38b641b0533b8.poster.avif?t=1675325063\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2286750/extras/6937badf4822cfd7a9b38b641b0533b8.webm?t=1675325063\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2286750/extras/6937badf4822cfd7a9b38b641b0533b8.mp4?t=1675325063\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
